  "description": "Han Yi-Sol, a high school freshman who loves birdwatching, is joined by Choi Ro-Woon, the unlucky top student in the entire school, and In Jeong-Min, who has been attending the same academy since middle school and has become her best friend. \n\n*\"One side treats me too harshly, and the other side overprotects me...!\"*\n\nThis is an observation of the love and friendship of young people just about to leave the nest.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
